        <h4 class="text-white font-semibold">Choose Shopify if...</h4>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mt-2">You want the easiest path to selling online. Ideal for dropshipping,
          small-medium catalogs, and businesses that value simplicity over customization.</p>
      </div>
