      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-4">
        <h4 class="text-white font-semibold">Choose BigCommerce if...</h4>
        <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mt-2">You need enterprise features without enterprise pricing. Great for B2B,
          wholesale, multi-channel selling, and businesses outgrowing Shopify.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-lg p-4">
        <h4 class="text-white font-semibold">Choose Squarespace/Wix if...</h4>
